{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060027/block/singleImage/3247059/df/1639934165_t3.jpg?updatedAt=1792752560\"/><figcaption>Uber與4駕校合作 推的士筆試優惠</figcaption></figure><p>Uber表示，與本地4間駕駛學校合作，推出新的司機優惠，為司機夥伴提供的士筆試，以及職前課程專屬優惠。 Uber指，司機夥伴於 12月31日或之前報讀指定課程，可享特惠學費；而Uber Pro白金級或鑽石級司機夥伴完成職前課程並成功通過的士筆試，更可獲500元現金回贈。 Uber提及，司機夥伴報名時須透過Uber Driver App核實身份並簽署同意書，而的士筆試亦可透過政府「牌證易」平台或運輸署網頁，以「智方便＋」網上預約，令報考流程更方便快捷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.911835+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:44:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:15:24.209573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:25.065533+00:00","content_hash":"60599924552eda85a6a9feb4ffe16935276612f384663a4f7201b1153773acbb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.911835+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}